  "tillverkar_beskrivning": {
    "text": "The folding arm awning Tucan combines a minimalist look with innovative features. Specially designed for apartment terraces, the Tucan is a lightweight screen and compact system which offers maximum sun protection. Sun canopy Tucan is characterised by a closed, rounded-edge box and offers a choice between a semi-open or closed system. The closed box keeps your fabric bright for years to come. Tucan is perfect for apartment terraces thanks to the light screen and compact system. Tucan can be easily installed against the wall or a ceiling. Tucan has a maximum width of 6 m, a maximum drop of 3,5 m, and can be fitted with a valance to keep the sun out when it is low in the sky.",
    "kalla": {
      "domän": "harol.com",
      "url": "https://www.harol.com/en/products/solar-shading/folding-arm-awnings/tucan/"
    },
    "kanal_typ": "tillverkare",
